# Everything in the repository is line-feed, whoever commits it and whichever
# platform checks it out. The Windows and Linux CI legs then build from identical
# bytes, and the generated files (which the generator writes with LF and compares
# byte for byte) do not depend on the checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artefacts that may end up next to a build, or a copied real DLL for
# export comparison: never touched.
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.exp binary
*.exe binary
*.pdb binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
